{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"\"Not bad, this city, starting to see the appeal.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T23:55:44.907000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-12T23:56:01.458000Z","id":"864293989520113665","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"She chuckles. \"I'm a big fan myself. Though of course i'm literally a part of it in a sense.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T23:56:22.766000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864294148312137729","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"\"You don't say? Do you flow all throughout this city as you please?\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T23:57:21.052000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864294392780029952","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"\"I'm always beggin the gods for a silver piece if you get my drift.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T23:58:04.643000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864294575615246376","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"\"I suppose i could, but i really like sticking around here. It's where I belong. As for finding silver in the water, i'll have to leave that to you, unless you fancy paying me for my efforts.\"","created_at":"2021-07-12T23:59:31.483000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864294939847426079","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"\"Ah what's that? do I detect a hint of saavy business in yer voice? What do you propose? I can find the coins meself, but perhaps you'd be interested in a sort of long term accord?\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T00:02:17.219000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864295634994200586","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"\"Oh i'm not the biggest fan of long-term commitments, but i do come across some silver now and then. I a-could give you some, if you were willing to give something in return.\" A wide grin has spread open on her face, and she begins to circle you in the water.","created_at":"2021-07-13T00:04:32.599000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864296202819207169","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"Evelyn arrives and leans on a railing to watch the scene in the water.","created_at":"2021-07-13T00:05:23.413000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864296415950143539","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"\"What could I possibly offer you that you don't have already? The waves themselves bow before you.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T00:06:06.236000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864296595562561546","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"\"I would likely too if it weren't for my raised guard in this new city\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T00:06:40.717000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-13T00:06:47.325000Z","id":"864296740185047071","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
